  "body": "* Double-glazed, three bedrooms, two bathrooms\r\n* North-facing, open-plan living\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Private, fully fenced lawn and covered outdoor entertaining\r\n* Renovated bathrooms, HRV system, heat pump and internal-access garage\r\n* Just 350 metres to Orewa Beach, with cafes, shops, schools and bush walks all close by\r\n* The owners have bought, so it must be sold!\r\n\r\nHere it is!\r\nThree bedrooms, two bathrooms, with tui calling in the native bush right across the road and the gentle waves of Orewa Beach just 350 metres away.\r\nWelcome to 22a Puriri Avenue.\r\nPrivate, peaceful, easy living by the beach.\r\n\r\nThe home was double-glazed in 2019.  \r\nNorth-facing, it is open, bright, warm and inviting, with the sea breeze never too far away.\r\n\r\nWhen you first walk in, you've got this big open-plan living and dining area that flows to private, covered outdoor entertaining. Perfect for family BBQs, special occasions, lazy Sundays and those inviting cool drinks on summer afternoons.\r\nThe family kitchen sits at the heart of the home, with lots of natural light, heaps of storage, laminate flooring and a composite stone benchtop.\r\n\r\nThere are three bedrooms. \r\nTwo downstairs with their own bathroom, and the master upstairs with a connected ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\nEach bedroom is private in its own way, but close to keep that sense of family together.\r\n\r\nThe bathrooms were renovated in 2023, with upstairs boasting some very sleek Italian tiles.\r\n\r\nThere is a Panasonic heat pump as well as a ducted HRV system into every bedroom and the main living area.  New carpet was laid in 2021, with the hot water cylinder also replaced in 2022.\r\n\r\nOutside, there is room for kids and pets with a fully fenced, private lawn as well as an internal-access single garage for cars, tools, toys, bikes, surfboards, etc.\r\n\r\nIt's easy to see why this part of the coast is such a desirable place to live.  Everything you need is so close! Top schools, cafes, shops, supermarkets, sports fields, bush walks, and public transport are also just a short distance away.\r\n\r\nThis is an outstanding opportunity for you to move in, make your own and enjoy the good life for many years to come.\r\n\r\nConjunctions welcome!",
